    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a medium-length single-player adventure game. You play as a young man who returns to a small town to his parents to restore an old church. Talk to the townspeople and help them. Help your father remember his past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mainly consists of dialogues and simple puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten takes about 4 hours to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game interface is minimalistic and does not distract from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics with an emphasis on realism and VR will help you fully immerse yourself in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are few locations in the game, and the main plot takes place in one small town. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Ten, you cannot lose or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is created for reflection and calm long dialogues, and not for action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a game about getting to know God and the importance of following his Commandments.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a medium-length single-player adventure game. You play as a young man who returns to a small town to his parents to restore an old church. Talk to the townspeople and help them. Help your father remember his past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mainly consists of dialogues and simple puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten takes about 4 hours to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game interface is minimalistic and does not distract from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics with an emphasis on realism and VR will help you fully immerse yourself in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are few locations in the game, and the main plot takes place in one small town. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Ten, you cannot lose or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is created for reflection and calm long dialogues, and not for action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a game about getting to know God and the importance of following his Commandments.</p>",
    "short_description": "A single-player game about faith, family, virtues - but also about vices and temptations that must be overcome. Find the path to truth, passing through the labyrinths of doubts and help those who have strayed from the path - and restore all...",
